  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity-building workshop on &#x2018;Living Heritage&#x2019; for ASPnet Teachers in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;promotion of a culture of peace and non-violence, global citizenship and appreciation of cultural diversity and of culture&#x2019;s contribution to sustainable development&#x2019; is an important target to achieve Goal 4 on quality education and lifelong learning opportunities for all as mentioned in the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. 

One of culture&#x2019;s manifestations is living heritage or intangible cultural heritage (ICH), including music and dances, festivals and rituals, making handicrafts and agricultural knowledge. These cultural practice and knowledge that are so meaningful to communities should be preserved and to transmit to future generation. This can be done in the schools.</narrative>
  </description>
